Package: goblin-mosh
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, openssh-client
Recommends: libio-socket-ip-perl
Conflicts: adam-mosh
Replaces: adam-mosh
Description: Mosh terminal and file transfers optimized for low-bandwidth links
 Goblin Mosh extends Mosh with zstd-22 compression, adaptive per-direction
 pacing, idle keepalive backoff, terminal graphics, and a two-pane file
 transfer menu using librsync and forward error correction.
 .
 Includes the client, server, goblin-moshcp, dictionary compiler, manual
 pages, and shell completion. The goblin-mosh command coexists with the
 distribution's mosh package; it does not replace /usr/bin/mosh.
